[en.FOCUS_C14_GUESTS_EMPIRE]
Meet Empire Ambassador

[en.FOCUS_C14_GUESTS_EMPIRE_desc]
When the Empire greets us on the holiday just as a gesture of goodwill, when it sends an official to an autonomous region but calls him an “ambassador”, I think we’ve already won.

[zh.FOCUS_C14_GUESTS_EMPIRE]
会见帝国特使

[zh.FOCUS_C14_GUESTS_EMPIRE_desc]
当帝国也为了面子前来祝贺我们节日快乐，当帝国派官员来到一个自治区却将其称之为“特使”的时候，我想我们已经赢了。

